[7724]={["atomIDs"]={"7724:description:1-142","7724:description:147-172","7724:description:174-198","7724:description:200-204","7724:description:213-282","7724:description:284-324","7724:description:326-379","7724:description:384-411","7724:description:413-440","7724:objective:1-81","7724:objective:83-168","7724:objective:173-270"},["opening"]="Hansel's latest orders concerned greater lava spiders. Oilfist's report of their fiery behavior gave him another task to pass along.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to reduce the lava spiders by twenty.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the spider assignment for Hansel.",["sourceHash"]="c5e5a7ead64f8739cc151cb9a39e9650db292e944c079cad929319bd73f4f3ac",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[7725]={["atomIDs"]={"7725:description:1-48","7725:description:50-166","7725:description:171-338","7725:description:343-421","7725:objective:1-98","7725:objective:101-244"},["opening"]="Zorbin remained in the market for shrinking residue after the first test. A smaller repeat supply of ten could still help, though he promised less compensation for further work.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to use the Ultra-Shrinker and bring Zorbin ten more residues.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered ten Miniaturization Residues from zapped giants to Zorbin.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="b982754abb98743ee2fd4cb4af22db70f1beae6defe4f9b25088bd6bbf0c7ae1",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[7726]={["atomIDs"]={"7726:description:1-19","7726:description:22-135","7726:description:138-232","7726:description:237-294","7726:description:297-375","7726:description:377-445","7726:description:448-494","7726:objective:1-176"},["opening"]="Opening the coastal shop still required more elemental cores. Zorbin reduced the repeat request to six, promising to spread word of the help among his goblin contacts.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to collect six Water Elemental Cores for Zorbin.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered six Water Elemental Cores to Zorbin Fandazzle.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="be90aef0ff1f6356be26edc14f46cb7614fcf0fcfbcf5e6176d6fc12bda7c0a4",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[7727]={["atomIDs"]={"7727:description:1-22","7727:description:24-46","7727:description:48-121","7727:description:123-150","7727:description:155-304","7727:description:306-397","7727:description:399-476","7727:objective:1-52","7727:objective:57-128","7727:objective:130-192","7727:objective:197-286"},["opening"]="The Brotherhood wanted to send explorers into the Slag Pit's lava pools. Incendosaurs obstructed the expedition, while Hansel's sore feet left the work delegated.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to confront twenty incendosaurs.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed Hansel's assignment in the lava pools.",["sourceHash"]="50d970679c378e05a07ee489200b6be09d8cae96132cfbe3f220c3f6c0a35c1c",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[7728]={["atomIDs"]={"7728:description:1-37","7728:description:42-63","7728:description:68-91","7728:description:96-177","7728:description:182-322","7728:description:327-440","7728:description:445-502","7728:objective:1-102","7728:objective:107-221","7728:objective:223-358"},["opening"]="The Brotherhood's notice named two stolen tools with different uses: a smith's tuyere and a lookout's spyglass. Both were believed taken by local Dark Irons.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to recover both tools for Scrange.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} returned the tuyere and spyglass.",["sourceHash"]="ad1d2135a2ebc2c70e6a89503508f1c286ff846586685a919c7a05a1bdf6a12c",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[7729]={["atomIDs"]={"7729:description:1-111","7729:description:116-265","7729:description:270-334","7729:description:339-390","7729:objective:1-55","7729:objective:57-143"},["opening"]="Scrange's recruitment notice sought help against competing Dark Iron crews. Taskmasters and slavers were the two named groups in the contract.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to complete Scrange's two-part assignment.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} reported the required taskmasters and slavers defeated.",["sourceHash"]="f7aef131806d617f35bab2a3a54fba7cfa1125c90c49833b86f0346c43b3c9d3",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[7730]={["atomIDs"]={"7730:description:1-113","7730:description:116-176","7730:description:179-296","7730:description:301-385","7730:description:388-503","7730:objective:1-77"},["opening"]="Hadoken's scouts identified an insect-like threat south of the Woodpaw. If the Zukk'ash were driving the gnolls' frenzy, he considered their numbers in the Writhing Deep a danger to Camp Mojache in their own right.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to recover twenty Zukk'ash Carapaces for Hadoken.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered twenty Zukk'ash Carapaces to Hadoken Swiftstrider.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="2f5c639d3447af2df9755a5a9faf7c321624d41bc926ea04f1a749c51a542931",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[7731]={["aftermath"]="Hadoken valued the glands as material for studying a potentially powerful insect. His camp still had to defend itself long enough to use what that study might reveal.",["atomIDs"]={"7731:description:1-164","7731:description:167-261","7731:description:264-299","7731:description:304-417","7731:description:420-484","7731:objective:1-115"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"7731:completion:1-17","7731:completion:19-34","7731:completion:37-158","7731:completion:161-248","7731:completion:253-326","7731:completion:329-338"},["opening"]="A scout described a much larger insect amid the Writhing Deep, secreting an aura unlike the others. Hadoken named it Stinglasher and wanted its glands studied for an answer to the new threat.",["pending"]="{actor} would confront Stinglasher and recover its glands for Hadoken.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the Stinglasher assignment and delivered its glands to Hadoken.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="e9873accf28ddf0fe287bcaea7240b6ee7e0dadef548215003bcdd40c0e878a3",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[7732]={["aftermath"]="Zilzibin identified the Zukk'ash as silithid and rejected the idea that they were a mindless nuisance. He saw an ancient danger the Horde had neglected and wanted help bringing it to light.",["atomIDs"]={"7732:description:1-96","7732:description:99-210","7732:description:215-311","7732:description:314-384","7732:description:387-488","7732:objective:1-62","7732:objective:65-100"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"7732:completion:1-29","7732:completion:32-59","7732:completion:61-132","7732:completion:135-183","7732:completion:188-252","7732:completion:255-403","7732:completion:408-498"},["opening"]="Hadoken did not consider the Zukk'ash danger ended. A report of the camp's findings was prepared for Zilzibin Drumlore, whose expertise in alien creatures might give the gathered lore a wider use.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to deliver the Camp Mojache Zukk'ash Report to Zilzibin.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the Camp Mojache Zukk'ash Report to Zilzibin Drumlore.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="2b8554e7ed9fd58192ea2f9e306dba255ef877cc3fb9bd5bd16f0f1d6e53c122",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[7733]={["atomIDs"]={"7733:description:1-84","7733:description:87-178","7733:description:181-304","7733:description:309-426","7733:objective:1-84"},["opening"]="Pratt's search for better leather now reached northern Rage Scar Hold. Its tougher yetis promised a finer material, and ten hides would finish the proposed trade at Feathermoon.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to bring ten Rage Scar Yeti Hides to Pratt.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered ten Rage Scar Yeti Hides to Pratt McGrubben.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="4a543f574d12a03c289e8543ce4cd98d38df2aca59646ff74616c285e755e2b3",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[7734]={["atomIDs"]={"7734:description:1-84","7734:description:87-178","7734:description:181-304","7734:description:309-426","7734:objective:1-79"},["opening"]="Jangdor had a new source in mind beyond the earlier Feral Scar hides. The yetis deep in Rage Scar Hold were more dangerous, but he wanted ten of their hides for the improvement in quality.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to recover ten Rage Scar Yeti Hides for Jangdor.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered ten Rage Scar Yeti Hides to Jangdor Swiftstrider.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="9b07fe999dd07103feb302336eb90a012a0f21708ae2b4234e68f5562fc2de99",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[7735]={["atomIDs"]={"7735:description:1-143","7735:description:148-302","7735:objective:1-87"},["opening"]="One pristine hide exceeded even the thick leather of Rage Scar yetis. Its sturdiness made it a likely object of interest to Pratt, whose work at Feathermoon demanded exceptional material.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to show the Pristine Yeti Hide to Pratt.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the Pristine Yeti Hide to Pratt McGrubben.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="518a48d6f53736c403537fcac6fc7435a1052186e42306efa77f28f058587e98",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[7736]={["atomIDs"]={"7736:description:1-64","7736:description:66-132","7736:description:135-180","7736:description:185-206","7736:description:209-222","7736:description:225-232","7736:description:237-269","7736:description:272-339","7736:objective:1-82"},["opening"]="The recovered recipe made replenishing flux the next concern. Burninate's herb-based method combined scales, kingsblood and coal.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to deliver the scales, herb and coal.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} supplied the kingsblood materials to Burninate.",["sourceHash"]="e80b1b85ea4d03f82ba20e2260e5dc1c7eca02e8f1ee894db7a744908c52d49f",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[7738]={["atomIDs"]={"7738:description:1-57","7738:description:60-185","7738:description:190-335","7738:objective:1-77"},["opening"]="The recovered hide seemed unusually close to perfect, thicker and sturdier than Rage Scar's ordinary yield. Jangdor's interest in quality made Camp Mojache its suggested destination.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to take the Perfect Yeti Hide to Jangdor.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the Perfect Yeti Hide to Jangdor Swiftstrider.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="8afa72e3aa338a873a8308ffabff99c9f11b52862f8cb55c25883d5f69732efd",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[7761]={["aftermath"]="The smoldering brand marked the hand with the sign required by the Orb of Command.",["atomIDs"]={"7761:description:1-9","7761:description:14-108","7761:description:110-250","7761:description:255-342","7761:description:344-417","7761:description:419-446","7761:description:451-474","7761:description:484-510","7761:objective:1-23","7761:objective:25-144","7761:objective:149-210","7761:objective:212-242"},["coverageQualification"]="INDIVIDUALLY_AUTHORED_RETAINED_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["endingAtomIDs"]={"7761:completion:1-73","7761:completion:75-91","7761:completion:96-131","7761:completion:133-161"},["minimumStage"]=2,["objectiveSummary"]="Gain the Mark of Drakkisath to use the Orb of Command.",["opening"]="Rend's intercepted letter revealed the orb's safeguard: only a bearer of Drakkisath's brand could use it to enter Blackwing directly. The general guarded that mark himself, making the letter an unintended guide past the protection.",["pending"]="{actor} would seek Drakkisath's brand.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} received the Mark of Drakkisath.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_SOURCE_READ_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_CERTIFIED",["sourceHash"]="a0643a57fd2515ccc6ac7038b59b4b1bc78c1a38aa6efc001c981afa90054781",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["unresolvedFields"]={"currentServerPlayability"}},
[7781]={["aftermath"]="Fordragon judged the result worthy of the kingdom's history. His praise marked the significance he assigned the trophy rather than adding details of its battle.",["atomIDs"]={"7781:description:1-24","7781:description:26-88","7781:description:90-153","7781:description:155-191","7781:objective:1-70"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"7781:completion:1-59","7781:completion:61-111","7781:completion:113-196"},["opening"]="Nefarian's enormous scarred head lay ready for return from Blackrock. Fordragon was to receive the trophy in Stormwind as evidence of the result against the Spire's lord.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to deliver the Head of Nefarian to Bolvar.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the Head of Nefarian to Highlord Bolvar Fordragon.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="1b81afff3221229fb31c5ecaaabf4d1c69a847c1aa668452aa875c800c104ef0",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[7782]={["aftermath"]="Afrasiabi bowed and prepared a public celebration. The return from Blackrock had reached its ceremonial acknowledgment.",["atomIDs"]={"7782:description:1-66","7782:objective:1-89"},["bridge"]="Nefarian's head had reached Fordragon. The field marshal in the Valley of Heroes was the next contact for the public recognition of that return.",["bridgeFrom"]=7781,["bridgeReplacesSetup"]=true,["endingAtomIDs"]={"7782:completion:1-31","7782:completion:36-81"},["opening"]="The report moved from Fordragon to Afrasiabi in the Valley of Heroes. The field marshal was the next contact named after the return from Blackrock.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to speak with Field Marshal Afrasiabi.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} spoke with Field Marshal Afrasiabi in the Valley of Heroes.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="cb10b3ef23a87f39c69ceb2be0c7e2440b7bfc3b81cddd4277fbd627aad8e034",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[7783]={["aftermath"]="Thrall confirmed Deathwing's son's death and wondered at the response of the greater evil.",["atomIDs"]={"7783:description:1-24","7783:description:26-88","7783:description:90-153","7783:description:155-191","7783:objective:1-51"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"7783:completion:1-41","7783:completion:43-73","7783:completion:75-101"},["opening"]="Nefarian's scarred head remained as the object to carry home. The next duty was presenting that evidence to the Warchief after the mountain's battle.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to bring the head to Thrall.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered Nefarian's head.",["sourceHash"]="b0a89392280c5fe839c4056b6802f7cd96d737de2f56be6344198d0cec58e974",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[7784]={["aftermath"]="Saurfang prepared to mount the head where it could be seen.",["atomIDs"]={"7784:description:1-58","7784:objective:1-47","7784:objective:49-100"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"7784:completion:1-76"},["opening"]="Thrall directed the acknowledgment onward to Saurfang. The veteran waited in the Valley of Strength for the next public step.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to speak with Saurfang.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} reached the high overlord.",["sourceHash"]="81f0dd097c0cf294c10c56cc9286f063a7d0708b2cc6b5a59c1015491620abf1",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[7785]={["aftermath"]="Demitrian invoked his master's blessing on the undertaking.",["atomIDs"]={"7785:description:1-42","7785:description:44-95","7785:objective:1-66"},["coverageQualification"]="INDIVIDUALLY_AUTHORED_RETAINED_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["endingAtomIDs"]={"7785:completion:1-37","7785:completion:39-72"},["minimumStage"]=2,["objectiveSummary"]="Examine the Vessel of Rebirth and return to Demitrian.",["opening"]="Demitrian presented a vessel as the means of the Windseeker's rebirth. Examining it was the immediate step he demanded before the work could proceed.",["pending"]="{actor} would examine the vessel and report to Demitrian.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} returned the examined vessel to Demitrian.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_SOURCE_READ_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_CERTIFIED",["sourceHash"]="c7de2fb45ac0d94fa6206939e2d20dff1540c191da1598a4d532daffae3d066d",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["unresolvedFields"]={"currentServerPlayability"}},
[7786]={["aftermath"]="Demitrian called for his master to rise and break the bonds, exulting in the release he had sought.",["atomIDs"]={"7786:description:1-36","7786:description:38-72","7786:description:74-130","7786:description:135-178","7786:objective:1-218"},["coverageQualification"]="INDIVIDUALLY_AUTHORED_RETAINED_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["endingAtomIDs"]={"7786:completion:1-47","7786:completion:52-66","7786:completion:71-108","7786:completion:113-156","7786:completion:161-175","7786:completion:177-198"},["minimumStage"]=2,["objectiveSummary"]="Bring Demitrian both bindings, ten elementium bars and the Firelord's essence.",["opening"]="Demitrian's proposed release of Thunderaan required both halves of the prison's bindings, rare elementium and the essence taken from the Firelord's corporeal form. The promised blessing depended on breaking that extraordinary confinement.",["pending"]="{actor} would gather the bindings, elementium and fiery essence.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} presented the required components to Demitrian.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_SOURCE_READ_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_CERTIFIED",["sourceHash"]="ca675488a539a708e258162500d9dcb875a4d0f6220a9c6f2cbc1bcfc69d9c35",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["unresolvedFields"]={"currentServerPlayability"}},
[7787]={["aftermath"]="Demitrian pleaded for his life and surrendered the awakened blade.",["atomIDs"]={"7787:description:1-34","7787:description:36-168","7787:objective:1-60"},["coverageQualification"]="INDIVIDUALLY_AUTHORED_RETAINED_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["endingAtomIDs"]={"7787:completion:1-22","7787:completion:24-31","7787:completion:33-47","7787:completion:49-93"},["minimumStage"]=2,["objectiveSummary"]="Present the dormant wind-kissed blade to Demitrian.",["opening"]="The Windseeker had been defeated, and Demitrian's betrayal had turned the promised blessing into a confrontation. The dormant blade now offered a means to force him to awaken Thunderfury with the materials already supplied.",["pending"]="{actor} would confront Demitrian with the dormant blade.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} presented the blade to Demitrian.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_SOURCE_READ_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_CERTIFIED",["sourceHash"]="7a5a3bb7fd5f0adec3ede6486d83878c618d32b5146bed0dce951f9716e14380",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["unresolvedFields"]={"currentServerPlayability"}},
[7788]={["atomIDs"]={"7788:description:1-73","7788:description:75-190","7788:description:195-241","7788:description:243-278","7788:description:283-320","7788:description:323-375","7788:objective:1-135"},["opening"]="Farsong's call began with the forest being cut away to feed the Horde's war machines. Silverwing Hold needed defenders, and a mark brought back from the gulch would show that the call had been answered.",["pending"]="{actor} would defend the Silverwings' position and bring a mark to Farsong.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} presented a Warsong mark to Sentinel Farsong.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_REVIEWED_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW_PENDING",["sourceHash"]="bc7d36f5002997a657ff97e6cb9b14f25ba4e1230b40cc61b3e9f4eebd7f35e6",["sourceRaceMask"]="1101",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVariantNote"]="Source-equivalent commission variants preserve their own IDs, levels and branch masks; wording does not imply distinct canonical events."},
[7789]={["atomIDs"]={"7789:description:1-77","7789:description:79-145","7789:description:147-176","7789:description:178-253","7789:description:258-351","7789:description:353-419","7789:description:422-481","7789:objective:1-144"},["opening"]="Shatterskull treated the Silverwings' defense as an obstruction to the Horde's right to harvest Ashenvale. He wanted their resistance broken and a mark returned to Mor'shan as evidence of service.",["pending"]="{actor} would take up the Outriders' cause and return a mark to Shatterskull.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} brought a Warsong mark to Captain Shatterskull.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_REVIEWED_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW_PENDING",["sourceHash"]="f228c4a5b10a9a4159eedfbcb6b7560b932032afd7757a3298c49b7d7d355fe7",["sourceRaceMask"]="690",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVariantNote"]="Source-equivalent commission variants preserve their own IDs, levels and branch masks; wording does not imply distinct canonical events."},
