[7838]={["aftermath"]="Short John named the returning contender Grandmaster of the Arena. His praise of earlier bloodshed was his characterization of the collected trophies.",["atomIDs"]={"7838:description:1-13","7838:description:119-124","7838:description:17-115"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"7838:completion:1-96"},["objectiveSummary"]="Bring twelve Arena Master trinkets to Short John Mithril.",["opening"]="Short John set the measure of grandmaster status at twelve Arena Master trinkets. The distinction required repeated trophies rather than a single claim.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to bring twelve Arena Master trinkets to Short John Mithril.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered twelve Arena Master trinkets to Short John Mithril.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="218cf26b9d92d5bced8075bcca80f7b5ecf0631e54ee02fa8e5112798dcf6851",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[7839]={["atomIDs"]={"7839:description:1-55","7839:description:57-188","7839:description:193-248","7839:description:253-341","7839:description:346-409","7839:description:414-430","7839:objective:1-95","7839:objective:97-137","7839:objective:142-281","7839:objective:283-315"},["opening"]="Slagtree's stolen tools mattered beyond their practical use: they were a gift from the gnome who saved him when young. Reports pointed toward northern temples and Skulk Rock.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to find and return the gifted tools.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} restored Slagtree's lost tool set.",["sourceHash"]="f4cb9066a73d4618e3135debe8725437a8920236aa291947b45351392e5796c4",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[7840]={["aftermath"]="Lard immediately ate the recovered meat and offered a special picnic basket in thanks.",["atomIDs"]={"7840:description:1-98","7840:description:100-148","7840:description:150-161","7840:description:163-222","7840:description:224-235","7840:description:237-244","7840:description:246-293","7840:objective:1-76","7840:objective:78-118","7840:objective:123-180","7840:objective:182-213"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"7840:completion:1-72","7840:completion:77-92","7840:completion:94-110","7840:completion:115-164"},["opening"]="A Vilebranch blow drove Lard from his island picnic without his food. Fear kept him in the village while hunger drew his attention back toward the northern hiding place.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to recover Lard's abandoned lunch.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} returned the food to Lard.",["sourceHash"]="a42ddfe2bdb63980bbf26abd3a009bb94d35b024bb471d4d0cd83202f9c3cf91",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[7841]={["atomIDs"]={"7841:description:1-76","7841:description:78-129","7841:description:134-146","7841:description:151-247","7841:description:249-336","7841:description:341-363","7841:objective:1-165","7841:objective:167-207","7841:objective:212-318"},["opening"]="Otho saw the Wildhammer's high-elven alliance as a reason for retaliation. His chosen message was an attack on the Highvale defenders at Quel'Danil.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to carry out the four-part Highvale assignment.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed Otho's attack on the Highvale forces.",["sourceHash"]="90029f3b72c4d9ac9863592e796bd284d58807611958e5e0e4e424b3c73d4343",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[7842]={["aftermath"]="Otho considered the materials ready for one remaining step.",["atomIDs"]={"7842:description:1-81","7842:description:83-143","7842:description:145-173","7842:description:178-250","7842:description:252-287","7842:objective:1-148","7842:objective:150-190","7842:objective:195-256"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"7842:completion:1-28","7842:completion:30-100"},["opening"]="Otho turned from the elves to the Wildhammer's close bond with gryphons. Feathers from the birds would become materials for a further threat.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to gather ten long feathers.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the gryphon feathers to Otho.",["sourceHash"]="68136594cbe3ebec85eaad3ae46b67a72a302278b2ca0b217fb32178fc337f00",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[7843]={["aftermath"]="Otho welcomed the report but could only imagine the dwarves' response.",["atomIDs"]={"7843:description:1-83","7843:description:88-106","7843:description:108-168","7843:description:170-182","7843:description:184-214","7843:description:216-259","7843:description:261-287","7843:description:289-318","7843:objective:1-208","7843:objective:210-250","7843:objective:255-324"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"7843:completion:1-63","7843:completion:65-95","7843:completion:97-109","7843:completion:114-131","7843:completion:133-142","7843:completion:144-177"},["opening"]="Otho had wrapped a bloodied spear in gryphon feathers. Planting it by Aerie Peak's central well would carry the threat directly into the Wildhammer settlement.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to plant the spear and return to Otho.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the display at Aerie Peak.",["sourceHash"]="8f4600ff36c31f4e22c79e3600aef80f7b4e821dc06b962bd4e551a8b7de98b5",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
